{
  "id": "bokeh",
  "label": "Bokeh Lights",
  "engine": "three",
  "kind": "picture",
  "mood": "out-of-focus photography — lights thrown into soft discs of several sizes with real lens character (brighter rims, colour fringes, cat's-eye discs towards the corners, grain) over a night or dusk ground; the subject is only hinted at by how the lights are arranged. Warm, cinematic, festive. Good for concerts and night events, year-end parties, city and film programmes, festivals, weddings and winter campaigns.",
